window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Skinwalkers is the second book in the VOLK series by award winning author, D. Werkmeister.<br> <br> Ancient Native American lore crashes into the modern world when a series of gruesome murders in the American Southwest catch the attention of FBI agent Terri Watson and her team. Convinced these killings are the work of a shapeshifter, they know they are the only ones who can stop the carnage.<br> <br> They aren’t blind to the dangers ahead and have a secret weapon: their foe turned friend, Alex, a werewolf herself. But this killer has no problem turning the hunters into the hunted.<br> <br> Skinwalkers is a fast paced, roller coaster of a book that will have you on the edge of your seat from the first minute.</p>"; 
